### attribute

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"nominal attribute t =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (fun () => global \"import lustre/internals/vdom\") : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'vdom.Attribute(`t)'\n    )","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  nominal attribute t =
      `(
          backend_switch `(()) `({}) {
              Gleam = (fun () => global "import lustre/internals/vdom") : () -> ()
          }
          $'' : $'vdom.Attribute(`t)'
      )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

