### simple

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl simple forall model msg.\n    (init : model -> model)\n    (update : model * msg -> model)\n    (view : model -> element msg)\n    : app model msg\n    =\n    global \"import lustre\"\n    $'lustre.simple(!init, fn (a, b) { !update(\\#(a, b)) }, !view)'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl simple forall model msg.
      (init : model -> model)
      (update : model * msg -> model)
      (view : model -> element msg)
      : app model msg
      =
      global "import lustre"
      $'lustre.simple(!init, fn (a, b) { !update(\#(a, b)) }, !view)'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

