<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl start id app =\n    $'let assert Ok(_) = lustre.start(!app, !id, 0)' : ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl start id app =
      $'let assert Ok(_) = lustre.start(!app, !id, 0)' : ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

## counter

<!-- livebook:{"break_markdown":true} -->

### model

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"type model = int","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  type model = int
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### init

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl init initial_count : model =\n    if initial_count < 0\n    then 0\n    else initial_count","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl init initial_count : model =
      if initial_count < 0
      then 0
      else initial_count
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### msg

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"union msg =\n    | Incr\n    | Decr","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  union msg =
      | Incr
      | Decr
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### update

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl update n (model, msg) =\n    match msg with\n    | Incr => model + n\n    | Decr => model - n","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl update n (model, msg) =
      match msg with
      | Incr => model + n
      | Decr => model - n
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### view

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl view model =\n    div [\n        style [\n            \"display\", \"flex\"\n        ]\n    ] [\n        div [\n            style [\n                \"display\", \"flex\"\n                \"flex-direction\", \"column\"\n            ]\n        ] [\n            button [\n                on_click Incr\n            ] [\n                text \"+\"\n            ]\n            p [\n                style [\n                    \"text-align\", \"center\"\n                ]\n            ] [\n                model |> sm'.obj_to_string |> text\n            ]\n            button [\n                on_click Decr\n            ] [\n                text \"-\"\n            ]\n        ]\n    ]","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl view model =
      div [
          style [
              "display", "flex"
          ]
      ] [
          div [
              style [
                  "display", "flex"
                  "flex-direction", "column"
              ]
          ] [
              button [
                  on_click Incr
              ] [
                  text "+"
              ]
              p [
                  style [
                      "text-align", "center"
                  ]
              ] [
                  model |> sm'.obj_to_string |> text
              ]
              button [
                  on_click Decr
              ] [
                  text "-"
              ]
          ]
      ]
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

